 order to achieve our dreams of entering the 2nd dimension, we will be making the popular light novel Spice and Wolf into a VR animation! Anime will evolve from something that is \u201cseen\u201d to something that is \u201cexperienced\u201d..."}]}, "developer_name": "SpicyTails", "developer_privacy_policy_url": null, "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "SpicyTails", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://spicy-tails.net/saw-vr/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1008279844328894"}, {"id": "2691890164460465"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ADVENTURE", "CASUAL", "NARRATIVE"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "ja", "zh_CN", "zh_TW"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "300358848823013"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 2, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1034340560247367"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "515405720151523"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1034340560247367"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1573754480, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1034340560247367"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "3254529497897482", "version": "1.04"}, "id": "373283759968622", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "2917608654922903", "is_concept": false,